    "nw_terms_of_service_content_eCje9M": {
      "type": "nw-terms-of-service-content",
      "blocks": {
        "content_item_1": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Use of Website & Orders",
            "content": "<p>By using our website, you agree to comply with these Terms of Service. We reserve the right to update product descriptions, pricing, availability, and content at any time without prior notice.</p><p>&nbsp;Orders may be canceled or refused due to technical errors, pricing inaccuracies, suspected fraud, or incorrect or incomplete information.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_MwedzH": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Promotion Terms (2026)",
            "content": "<p><strong>Promotional periods. </strong>Black Friday Early: November 1 – November 25, 2026, ending at 11:59 PM EST. Black Friday / Cyber Monday: November 26 – December 1, 2026, ending at 11:59 PM EST</p><p><strong>Cyber Monday 25% off is final sale. </strong>Purchases made with the Cyber Monday 25% off offer are final sale. They are not eligible for return, refund, exchange, or the 100-Night Trial, even if the item is unopened.</p><p><strong>Free gifts are non-returnable.</strong> For all promotions, free gifts (including free pillows offered with a mattress purchase) are non-returnable and are not eligible for a refund or credit.</p><p><strong>Offer terms apply.</strong> Promotions are subject to the terms listed with each offer, including product and size eligibility (for example, valid only on Queen and King sizes and not valid on bundles). Offers apply automatically at checkout, cannot be combined with other discounts unless stated, and are valid only during the promotional periods above and while supplies last.</p><p><strong>Right to refuse or revoke.</strong> We reserve the right to refuse or revoke any discount. If a discount is revoked, the order will be refunded in full.</p><p><strong>Warranty unaffected.</strong> Final sale status does not affect your product warranty.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_G9nygG": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns, 100-Night Trial & Warranty",
            "content": "<p>Mattresses include a 100-night trial beginning on the delivery date, with a 30-night break-in period, as described in our <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\" title=\"Shipping Policy\">Shipping & Returns Policy</a>. Adjustable bases and bed frames, and any purchase identified as final sale, are not eligible for return or exchange. Our mattresses carry a 30-year limited warranty and our adjustable bases carry a 20-year warranty; see our <a href=\"/pages/general-customer-education\" title=\"General Customer Education\">warranty page</a> for coverage and exclusions. If these Terms conflict with a posted promotion’s final-sale terms, the promotion’s terms apply to that purchase.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_2": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Secure Payments, Financing & HSA/FSA",
            "content": "<p>All payments are processed through secure third-party payment providers, including Shopify Payments, Shop Pay, Affirm, and Acima. HSA/FSA purchases may be supported through TrueMed. <strong>The Ultimate Snooze does not store or have access to your full payment information.</strong></p><p>Financing and lease-to-own options (such as<br/>Affirm and Acima) are offered by those third parties, are subject to their<br/>approval, terms, and privacy policies, and may not be available for every<br/>order. HSA/FSA eligibility and reimbursement are determined by TrueMed and your<br/>plan administrator; we do not provide tax or medical advice.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_3": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Comfort & Product Disclaimer",
            "content": "<p>Comfort, firmness, and feel are subjective and may vary from person to person. We are not responsible for individual comfort preferences, provided the product delivered matches the description and specifications listed at the time of purchase.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_4": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials & Allergy Disclaimer",
            "content": "<p>Our products are made using organic Dunlop or Talalay latex, organic wool, and organic cotton, and may also include other natural and synthetic materials and ingredients. The specific materials used in each product are listed on that product’s page, and you should review them before purchase. While natural materials are commonly considered hypoallergenic, individual sensitivities and allergic reactions can vary.</p><p>The Ultimate Snooze does not guarantee that our products are free from allergens and is not responsible for allergic reactions, sensitivities, or health responses that may occur as a result of using our products. Customers with known allergies or sensitivities, including latex sensitivity, should consult a medical professional prior to purchase and use.</p><p>By purchasing and using our products, you acknowledge and accept responsibility for determining whether the materials are suitable for your individual health needs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_QNyiHC": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Communications",
            "content": "<p>If you opt in to marketing emails or SMS, you consent to receive marketing messages from us. Message frequency may vary, and message and data rates may apply. You may unsubscribe at any time by clicking the unsubscribe link or replying STOP. We may send transactional and customer support messages related to your order without marketing opt-in.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_Gyh4zK": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Third-Party Services & Tracking Technologies",
            "content": "<p>We use third-party services to operate our website, process orders, and measure and improve performance and advertising. These include Shopify and Shop Pay (store platform and checkout), Affirm, Acima, and TrueMed (payments, financing, and HSA/FSA), Google Analytics 4 and Google Tag Manager, Microsoft Clarity, the Meta (Facebook) Pixel, the TikTok Pixel, Klaviyo (email and SMS), <a href=\"https://smile.io/\" title=\"https://smile.io/\">Smile.io | The Leading Loyalty Platform for Shopify Brands </a>(rewards), Mulberry (protection plans), and LeadConnector (forms and communications). These providers may use cookies and similar technologies and handle information under their own privacy policies. We may add or remove providers over time. See our Privacy Policy for details and your choices.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_FWHgp6": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Colorado Privacy Rights",
            "content": "<p>If you are a Colorado resident, you may have the right under the Colorado Privacy Act, to the extent it applies to us, to: confirm whether we process your personal data and access it; correct inaccuracies; delete your personal data; obtain a portable copy of your data; and opt out of the processing of your personal data for targeted advertising, the sale of personal data, or profiling that produces legal or similarly significant effects.</p><p>To exercise these rights, email <a href=\"mailto:info@theultimatesnooze.com\" title=\"mailto:info@theultimatesnooze.com\">info@theultimatesnooze.com</a> or use the opt-out options on our <a href=\"/pages/data-sharing-opt-out\" title=\"Your Privacy Choices\">Your Privacy Choices</a> page. We recognize universal opt-out signals, such as the Global Privacy Control, as a request to opt out of targeted advertising and the sale of personal data. We will respond within 45 days, and may extend once by 45 more days where reasonably necessary, and we will tell you if we do. If we decline your request, you may appeal by replying to our decision or emailing us with “Appeal” in the subject line, and we will respond to the appeal within 45 days of receiving it. If you are not satisfied with the outcome of your appeal, you may contact the Colorado Attorney General.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_5": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Intellectual Property",
            "content": "<p>All content on this website, including text, images, graphics, logos, videos, and design elements, is the property of <strong>The Ultimate Snooze LLC</strong> and is protected by intellectual property laws. This content may not be copied, reproduced, distributed, or used without prior written permission.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_6": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Limitation of Liability",
            "content": "<p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, The Ultimate Snooze LLC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our website or products.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_GqFLWD": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Changes to These Terms",
            "content": "<p>We may update these Terms of Service from time to time. The updated version will be posted on this page with a new “Last Updated” date, and applies to orders placed after that date.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_7": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Governing Law",
            "content": "<p>These Terms of Service are governed by and interpreted in accordance with the laws of the United States of America, without regard to conflict-of-law principles.</p>"
          }
        },
        "content_item_8": {
          "type": "content_item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Contact Information",
            "content": "<p>If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:</p><p><strong>The Ultimate Snooze LLC</strong><br/>102 Oneida Street Pueblo,<br/>CO 81003</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:info@theultimatesnooze.com\">info@TheUltimateSnooze.com</a></p>"
          }
        }
